OL,3,ABuilding boom puts 300,000 people in
OL,4,Athe path of potential Himalayan
OL,5,Adisasters
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 300,000 people in parts of the
OL,8,FHimalayan region could now be living in
OL,9,Fthe path of potential disasters, a new
OL,10,Fstudy suggests.
OL,12,FResearchers found that the amount of
OL,13,Fbuilt-up land in high-risk zones in
OL,14,Fnorthern Nepal, parts of south-eastern
OL,15,FTibet and a corner of India's
OL,16,FUttarakhand had grown by about 45%
OL,17,Fbetween 2016 and 2023.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
