OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABuilding boom puts 300,000 people in
OL,4,Athe path of potential Himalayan
OL,5,Adisasters
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn areas particularly threatened by
OL,8,Fflooding from glacial lakes,
OL,9,Fdevelopment increased even faster,
OL,10,Frising by almost 78% over the same
OL,11,Fperiod, according to the peer-reviewed
OL,12,Fstudy published in Scientific Reports.
OL,14,FThe team of scientists behind it said
OL,15,Fthe true number of people under threat
OL,16,Fcould be much higher, as they only
OL,17,Fanalysed a specific territory and not
OL,18,Fneighbouring areas which face similar
OL,19,Frisks.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
